  "content": "<hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display:table\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Vs9AVkxjYY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZEORx0F.png\" width=\"225\" height=\"75\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LrVLC2a.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252ftranslate%252froughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2X5V8hc.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/shedaniel_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3cRJyIY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a><br></span></p><p><strong>在 Forge 上你需要 REIPC：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items-hacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/shedaniel_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p><p><em>簡潔且可自訂。瀏覽合成配方的最佳方式。</em></p><p>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a>。</p><p>下載內容包含 Forge 和 Fabric 兩個版本的檔案！請下載正確的版本！</p><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.21.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.21.2 至 1.21.3 (REI 17)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.21.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.21 至 1.21.1 (REI 16)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.20.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.20.5 至 1.20.6 (REI 15)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.20.4 (REI 14)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.20.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.20.2 (REI 13)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.20\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.20 至 1.20.1 (REI 12)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.19.4 (REI 11)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.19.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.19.3 (REI 10)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.19\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.19 至 1.19.2 (REI 9)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.18.2 (REI 8)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.18.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.18 至 1.18.1 (REI 7)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.17 至 1.17.1 (REI 6)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.16.4 至 1.16.5 (REI 5/6)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.16.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.16.2 至 1.16.3 (REI 5)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.16.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.16 至 1.16.1 (REI 4)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.15.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.15 至 1.15.2 (REI 3)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.14.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.14 至 1.14.4 (REI 3)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.13.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.13.2 (REI 2)</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.13\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.13 (REI 2)</a></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TfttQKk.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">需要伺服器來和朋友一起玩嗎？或者不知道如何架設？只需租用一台已經配置好的伺服器！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fshedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" alt=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" width=\"333\" height=\"108\"> </a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;點擊上圖，選擇方案（至少 4 GB），使用我的代碼 <strong>shedaniel</strong> 即可在首月享受 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣，盡情和朋友們一起遊玩！</p><p><strong>匯出配方：</strong></p><p>REI 提供了一個預設未綁定的按鍵，可用於匯出配方，下面是範例：</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uG2NNLw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"132\"></p><p><strong>JEI 插件支援： (Forge)</strong></p><p>這確實支援 JEI 插件。部分模組可能需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items-hacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI 相容性解決方案</a>。</p><p>如果你希望在伺服器上同時支援 JEI 和 REI 使用者，請在伺服器上同時安裝 JEI 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items-server-component\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI 伺服器元件</a>。</p><p><strong>收藏 / 書籤：</strong></p><p>將物品加入收藏的方法是，在懸停任何物品時按下 <strong>A</strong> 鍵。</p><p><strong>進階搜尋：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><strong>搜尋模式</strong><br><strong>模組：</strong> <code>@模組名稱</code>\n<p>不區分大小寫，透過模組搜尋，例如 <code>@materialisation</code> 來搜尋由 materialisation 新增的物品。</p>\n<strong>提示文字：</strong> <code>#文字</code>\n<p>不區分大小寫，透過提示文字搜尋，例如 <code>#保護</code> 來搜尋保護附魔書。</p>\n<strong>標籤：</strong> <code>$標籤</code>\n<p>不區分大小寫，透過標籤搜尋，例如 <code>$原木</code> 來搜尋原木。</p>\n<strong>正規表達式：</strong> <code>r/正規表達式/</code>\n<p>區分大小寫，透過正規表達式搜尋，例如 <code>r/(金 )?蘋果)</code> 來搜尋金蘋果或蘋果。</p>\n<strong>引號：</strong>\n<p>允許空格，例如 <code>\"#保護 III\"</code> 來搜尋帶空格的內容。</p>\n<strong>或：</strong> <code>|</code>\n<p>或運算，例如 <code>蘋果|$原木</code> 來搜尋蘋果或原木。</p>\n</div><p><strong>版本路線圖：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4V9o02v.png\" width=\"1905\" height=\"521\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uvBmJsf.png\" width=\"1425\" height=\"390\"></p><h4>REI 5</h4><p>Fabric 1.16.x - 錯誤修復至 2022 年 2 月 28 日</p><h4><br>REI 6</h4><p>Forge 1.16.x - 功能更新至 2022 年 3 月（至少）</p><p>Fabric 1.17.x - 功能更新至 2022 年 3 月（至少）</p><p>Forge 1.17.x - 功能更新至 2022 年 3 月（至少）</p><h4>REI 7</h4><p>Fabric 1.18.x - 功能更新至 1.19（至少）</p><p>Forge 1.18.x - 功能更新至 1.19（至少）</p><p>透過完成這份問卷來幫助 REI，我們感謝每一份回覆。</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSddhg6CdI9isLb2OpmDGQZwWgMUYk9RjwtAfDrs-ISeJuYZMg/viewform?embedded=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\">載入中…</iframe></span></span></p><p><strong>請勿在留言區尋求支援，支援服務在 Discord 伺服器中提供！</strong></p>",
